{
  "schema": "rcv-cases/1",
  "about": "Shared reference-change-value cases for three separate implementations: longevity-analyst (lalib/twin.py, twin compare), longevity-coach (scripts/noise.py) and LongPi (src/reference.ts rcvBand, src/honesty/comparability.ts compareGate). Each implementation keeps its own code and verdict words; `expect` gives the verdict each one must reach, or not_applicable where that path does not take the input. Numbers come from longevity-skills data/biological_variation.json (z 1.96, CVA defaults to 0.5 x CVI when the table has none).",
  "formula": "RCV = sqrt(2) x z x sqrt(CVA^2 + CVI^2); log-normal markers: exp(+/- z x sqrt(2) x sqrt(ln(CVI^2+1) + ln(CVA^2+1))) - 1; means of k1 and k2 separate-day results: replace sqrt(2) by sqrt(1/k1 + 1/k2)",
  "z": 1.96,
